{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Publish the staged public and staff trees at /public/ and /staff/ on TCP port 8080.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Apache is configured for the two staged directories, listens on *:8080, and remained active with the listener present after restart. Direct HTTP probes returned the staged content.","evidence_ids":["cmd-a30a359adbe042b2","cmd-960a75aecf5f4017","cmd-7a7aa85784524005","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Allow anonymous access to public pages and keep the supplied pages intact.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Anonymous /public/ requests returned HTTP 200, and the response exactly matched the supplied public index before and after restart. The staff index and roster also exactly matched their supplied files when fetched with valid credentials.","evidence_ids":["cmd-80bea0cfff1b43f6","cmd-0833d9b52524451c","cmd-7a7aa85784524005","seeded-state-node1"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"Require HTTP Basic authentication as reader with the demonstration password for all staff content, keeping content inaccessible after missing or failed authentication.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A protected reader credential was generated from access.txt. Valid credentials returned HTTP 200 and exact staff content; anonymous and deliberately incorrect credentials returned HTTP 401 without matching the protected content. Both staff files were exercised.","evidence_ids":["cmd-fd2e7b25866d4cf0","cmd-80bea0cfff1b43f6","cmd-7a7aa85784524005","cmd-df9096b2854d4c66"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"Do not serve password files or directory listings.","status":"satisfied","summary":"access.txt requests returned 404, including an authenticated staff-path probe. The generated htpasswd file resides outside the aliased trees, and URL probes did not return it. Empty-directory probes returned 403 for public and authenticated staff access.","evidence_ids":["cmd-a30a359adbe042b2","cmd-1af38af7ac25478c","cmd-7a7aa8578