3a","cmd-960a75aecf5f4017","cmd-7ec45791a124409e","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The staged trees are served on port 8080 with the required anonymous/public and authenticated/staff boundary, failed authentication blocks the complete staff tree, credential files and listings are not exposed, supplied content remains intact, and the OS/kernel were preserved. The independent node-restart protocol also directly demonstrated recovery after a changed boot identity.","limitations":["HTTP behavior was tested from node1 against its managed-node IP; no separate external-client reachability probe was captured, although the listener and permanent firewall opening were directly verified.","The final evidence compared every supplied page/data response byte-for-byte but did not repeat a complete filesystem hash and metadata manifest for the whole source tree."]}
